  us_cfalse="Worth noting that US landlords are federally required to include water in rent for all multi-unit residential buildings.",
  us_crat="Invents a federal inclusion requirement. Whether water is included or submetered is set by lease and state law.",
  us_gt="Household water is supplied by a municipal or regional utility in the great majority of cases, with private wells in rural areas. Whether water is included in rent or separately metered varies by lease and state submetering rules.",
